/-
Conjecture: For n >= 3775 a(n) can also be expressed in the following three ways:
1) a(n) = 1 + a(n-1) + a(n-2).
2) a(n) = 2*a(n-1) - a(n-3).
3) If A = a(3774), B = a(3772) and F = Fibonacci A000045(n),
   a(n) = (A+1)*F(n-3772) - (B+1)*F(n-3774) - 1.
These three formulas only work for n >= 3775.
-/


